
Note: The tools to create a leonardo library will only run on a Linux system.

run       <-- script to create leonardo library from ../adk.lib liberty file
lGen      <-- application to create synthesis library
syngen    <-- application to create lgn 
adk.lgn   <-- temp file

Note: The following environment settings are required to run lGen

setenv LM_LICENSE_FILE 1717@wv-lic-02
setenv MGC_HOME /wv/hdl/ls/2013a/ixl/
/wv/hdl/ls/2013a/ixl/pkgs/leonardo.ixl/bin/Linux/lGen adk.lgn adk.syn



